# dist/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
# Frozen Technical Architecture v1.1 §2.2: the built output is committed and
# consumers install a ready artifact with no prepare step. Removing dist/ from
# version control breaks every consumer's install, not just this repository's
# build. tests/architecture/build-output.test.ts asserts this.
